  <section>
    <div class="eyebrow">Path 3 · realm listen</div>
    <h2>A webhook front door that starts runs</h2>
    <p><code>realm listen</code> does not drive anything itself. It accepts a request, creates the run and hands it to <code>realm agent</code>. Expired gates are settled only if it was started with <code>--sweep-expired-gates</code>.</p>
